  (text "Battery cartridge: 5S protector, FETs, fuse, isolated gauge"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 20 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "b11b0afb-4d3e-56e3-a4bb-0a93f95ffddc"))
  (text "X-4 isolation: gauge/protector reference = CELL0. Main board reference = PACK_N (pogo GND + XT60-), which floats from -21 V to +21 V vs CELL0 when the FETs are open. Nothing on the main side touches CELL0: I2C crosses ISO1540 U4 (side 1 = main, side 2 = gauge), CART_EN crosses PC817 U5, PRES_A/B is a floating loop."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 23.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "267d798b-17c9-5e4b-8e79-ac63ed2408c6"))
  (text "X-3 enable: pack FETs stay OFF until the main board drives CART_EN high (3.3 V, >= 2.5 mA, ref. pogo GND). CART_EN low/open -> opto off -> CTRC/CTRD pulled to VDD via 10M (DISABLED, EC 2.04..VDD+0.7 V) -> CHG+DSG off within ~8 ms (t_CTRDEG). Main board: detect cartridge by gauge ACK (0x55) through the isolator, read voltage, keep its own VBAT hot-swap switch OPEN, assert CART_EN, wait >= 20 ms, then ramp (precharge) its hot-swap."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 27 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "78de889a-ef72-5dd1-a149-fe786320db6d"))
  (text "X-31 pogo targets (cartridge = flat ENIG pads D3.0 mm, pitch >= 4 mm; springs on the main board). Mating order: 1 GND (PACK_N) first-make/last-break; 2 CART_3V3, 3 CART_SDA, 4 CART_SCL, 5 PRES_A, 6 PRES_B mid; 7 CART_EN last-make/first-break. XT60 mates with FETs open (no current path); XT60 must stay mated >= 3 mm of travel after CART_EN breaks, or the bay latch-release must drop CART_EN first."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 30.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "129b8b94-8e8c-58fa-9e77-90b25555a22b"))
