          (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
    (property "Note" "X-10: I_pf = 21.0 V / (5 x 7 mOhm cell min + 1 mOhm Ni/Cu min) = 583 A, fault at the fuse load side (bypasses RSNS+FETs). 7 mOhm = 50S AC 10.0-2 mOhm (Samsung) less 15 % for warm cells; DC is 16.3 mOhm typ so this is a floor. Fuse cold R (2.06 mOhm) ignored. 3 x 583 = 1750 A <= 2500 A @ 58 VDC (4.3:1). Littelfuse MIDI bolt-in, 41 x 12 mm: footprint = 2x M5 press-fit studs per 0498 drawing (custom, TBD at layout)."
      (at 232.41 48.26 0)
